s for generated for a given issue resolve the issue.ReviewersGPT-4oGemini 1.5 ProGemini 2.0 FlashClaude 3.5 SonnetClosed SourceGPT-4o62.12 48.1950.0051.02Open SourceR171.64 78.3164.0674.49R1-Distill-7B 53.73 54.2256.2541.84R1-Distill-14B 65.67 56.6354.6954.08R1-Distill-32B 67.16 66.2762.5059.18Fine-tunedR1-Distill-7B 55.22 54.2257.8151.02R1-Distill-14B 71.64 59.0460.9460.20R1-Distill-32B 70.15 63.8665.6261.22","level":1,"path_id":"1~72","parent_section_id":null,"order_in_parent":75,"section_id":"sec-1~72"},{"title":"Table 8 :","text":"8Comparison of various types of syntactical errors committed in whole and diff setting.GPT-4o-mini Gemini 1.5 (Pro)Whole Diff WholeDiffTotal Edits11,931 8,507 3,6054,113Success Samples 4,905 3,090 1,9952,590Success Rate (%) 41.1 36.3 55.362.9Error TypesNo Match01,1590655Content Error01,6400143Syntax Error7,003 2,600 1,610706File Error018019Pass@1 (%)78.67 14.3821.44","level":1,"path_id":"1~73","parent_section_id":null,"order_in_parent":76,"section_id":"sec-1~73"},{"title":"Table 9 :","text":"9Various models' ability to correctly localize issues.ModelCorrect Localization (%)GPT-4o74.37Claude 3.5 Sonnet80.70Gemini 2.0 Flash69.44Gemini 1.5 Pro64.82","level":1,"path_id":"1~74","parent_section_id":null,"order_in_parent":77,"section_id":"sec-1~74"},{"title":"Table 10 :","text":"10Comparison of path reaches by action type.Here, before and after expansion pertain to cases where conclusion is only reached before and after expansion respectivelyActionAfter Expansion Before ExpansionEdit3239Create4127Append3436Submit-24ActionAvg Dep Bef ExpAvg Dep Aft ExpEdit21.220.8Create22.421.4Append22.122.6Submit16.922.1","level":1,"path_id":"1~75","parent_section_id":null,"order_in_parent":78,"section_id":"sec-1~75"},{"title":"Table 13 :","text":"13Compute-coverage trade-off of expanding in various actions. Here Avg Iter pertains to average number of iterations across issues which indicates the amount of compute spent in that issue.Action Type Error TypesSWE